    "detailed_description": "Run, jump, grapple, and pop your way to emerge victorious amongst your friends!<br />\r\n<br />\r\n- Play as adorable dinosaurs across 60 pre-designed gamemodes.<br />\r\n- 60 modes not enough for you? Mix it up by choosing from and combining 50 gameplay mutators.<br />\r\n- Still not enough variety?! Build your own gamemodes from 100s of further options that can be combined together however you like.<br />\r\n- Customise your dinosaur! Want to be royalty? A pirate? Wear a cone-of-shame? Be the dinosaur you always wanted to be!<br />\r\n<br />\r\nParty Poppers follows in the footsteps of Party Golf and Party Crashers with the same incredible customisation options and crazy competitive couch gameplay you know and love. There's a gamemode for everyone!<br />\r\n- Capture the Flag<br />\r\n- King of the Hill / Domination<br />\r\n- Race mode<br />\r\n- The Floor is Lava<br />\r\n- Boopmatch<br />\r\n- Tag",
    "about_the_game": "Run, jump, grapple, and pop your way to emerge victorious amongst your friends!<br />\r\n<br />\r\n- Play as adorable dinosaurs across 60 pre-designed gamemodes.<br />\r\n- 60 modes not enough for you? Mix it up by choosing from and combining 50 gameplay mutators.<br />\r\n- Still not enough variety?! Build your own gamemodes from 100s of further options that can be combined together however you like.<br />\r\n- Customise your dinosaur! Want to be royalty? A pirate? Wear a cone-of-shame? Be the dinosaur you always wanted to be!<br />\r\n<br />\r\nParty Poppers follows in the footsteps of Party Golf and Party Crashers with the same incredible customisation options and crazy competitive couch gameplay you know and love. There's a gamemode for everyone!<br />\r\n- Capture the Flag<br />\r\n- King of the Hill / Domination<br />\r\n- Race mode<br />\r\n- The Floor is Lava<br />\r\n- Boopmatch<br />\r\n- Tag",
    "short_description": "Run, jump, grapple, and pop your way to emerge victorious amongst your friends! Play as adorable dinosaurs across 60 pre-designed gamemodes. Or combine any of our 50 gameplay mutators, or even build your own gamemodes from 100s of further options that can be combined together however you like.",
